 "stimulus_html": "Campaignmonitor.com is a company that helps entrepreneurs set up a user-friendly email advertisement campaign. It has lengthy <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/78EmailAd\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">guidelines on how to design a professional email ad</a> and lots of infographics and screen captures of excellent examples.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 375989,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Now that you are more knowledgeable on email ads, design your own brief “flyer”-type email. Go to <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/78MicTemplate\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft’s template</a> page and type \"flyer\" into the search bar to find a flyer template that you like. Try to implement the lessons from campaignmonitor.com when you design your own.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
   "id": 375990,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The flyer can be about a product or organization you are familiar with, such as a school group or the brand of cell phone you use. Include a description of the product or organization and the overall features that are appealing.",
